        <span begin="03:29.530" end="03:29.770">That </span>
        <span begin="03:29.770" end="03:29.950">my </span>
        <span begin="03:29.950" end="03:30.310">heart </span>
        <span begin="03:30.310" end="03:30.580">don't </span>
        <span begin="03:30.580" end="03:30.910">know </span>
        <span begin="03:30.910" end="03:31.960">already </span>
        <span begin="03:31.960" end="03:32.290">?</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="03:32.290" end="03:34.510" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="03:32.290" end="03:32.530">'Cause </span>
        <span begin="03:32.530" end="03:32.710">we </span>
