        <span begin="03:33.730" end="03:34.510">sense</span>
      </p>
      <p begin="03:34.990" end="03:36.910" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="03:34.990" end="03:35.230">And </span>
        <span begin="03:35.230" end="03:35.410">you're </span>
